  m_Text: 'Example of generating whole flat building including inside rooms.

    It''s
    using custom coded script which uses few generators.

    It generates elevator
    which can bring you to other floor levels.


    WSAD keys - Movement

    Hold
    Right Mouse Button - Rotate Camera

    Space Key - Jump


    0,1,2 up to 9
    inside elevator - Go to other floor level'
